This file consolidates the codebase authors of LINE across its language-specific
implementations (matlab/, java/, kotlin/, python/, python-wrapper/). Per-module
AUTHORS files are retained in each subfolder. Each contributor is listed once;
the modules and releases they contributed to are noted in parentheses.

